# Redirects for the move from the Wix site to this one.
#
# Built from the eight pages ICB's IT department listed on 27 Oct 2026,
# with their thirty-day view counts. Every old address that is not
# answered here returns a 404 after the cutover, and Google drops
# whatever position that page held, so this file is the thing that
# carries ICB's existing search results across.
#
# Netlify reads this from the root of the published folder. The build
# copies it if it finds it; see SHIP in build/build-static.js.
#
# Format: old path, new path, status. Netlify matches a trailing slash
# either way and keeps any query string.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pages that moved. Views over thirty days in brackets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

